## 1. API Endpoint Reference

### API #74 — Create Placement Result

| Item | Value |
|------|-------|
| **Method** | `POST` |
| **URL** | `/api/college/create_placement` |
| **Auth** | Bearer Token (COLLEGEADMIN or TPO) |

#### Request Body

```json
{
  "application_id": "a1b2c3d4-....",
  "placement_type": "full-time",
  "fulltime_package": 650000,
  "fulltime_designation": "Software Engineer",
  "fulltime_joining_date": "2026-07-01",
  "offer_letter_url": "https://storage.example.com/offers/tcs_rahul.pdf"
}
```

| Field | Type | Required | Validation |
|-------|------|----------|------------|
| `application_id` | UUID | ✅ | Must be `selected` or `offered` status |
| `placement_type` | string | ✅ | `full-time`, `internship`, `both` |
| `fulltime_package` | number | ✅ when type=`full-time`/`both` | ≥ 0, 2 decimal places |
| `fulltime_designation` | string | ❌ | max 200 chars |
| `fulltime_joining_date` | ISO date | ❌ | Must be future date |
| `internship_stipend` | number | ✅ when type=`internship`/`both` | ≥ 0 |
| `internship_duration` | string | ❌ | max 100 chars |
| `internship_start_date` | ISO date | ❌ | Must be future date |
| `offer_letter_url` | string | ❌ | Valid URL, max 2000 chars |

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - Auto-resolves `student_id`, `company_id`, `job_id`, `position_id`, `passout_year` from the application
> - Auto-sets `placement_status = 'offered'`, `acceptance_status = 'pending'`
> - Auto-updates application status to `offered` if it was `selected`
> - Duplicate check: only one placement per application

#### Success Response (201)

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Placement record created successfully",
  "data": {
    "placement_id": "...",
    "placement_type": "full-time",
    "fulltime_package": 650000,
    "placement_status": "offered",
    "acceptance_status": "pending",
    "student_name": "Rahul Sharma",
    "company_name": "TCS",
    "job_title": "Software Developer",
    "dept_name": "Computer Science"
  }
}
```

