### API #75 — List All Placements

| Item | Value |
|------|-------|
| **Method** | `GET` |
| **URL** | `/api/college/get_all_placements` |

#### Query Parameters

| Param | Type | Required | Description |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| `passout_year` | number | ❌ | Filter by year (also scopes stats) |
| `company_id` | UUID | ❌ | Filter by company |
| `job_id` | UUID | ❌ | Filter by job |
| `placement_status` | string | ❌ | `offered`, `accepted`, `rejected`, `joined`, `cancelled` |
| `placement_type` | string | ❌ | `full-time`, `internship`, `both` |
| `acceptance_status` | string | ❌ | `accepted`, `rejected`, `pending` |
| `offer_letter_verified` | string | ❌ | `true` or `false` |
| `search` | string | ❌ | Search student name, email, company, job title |
| `sort_by` | string | ❌ | `created_at` (default), `fulltime_package`, `student_name`, `placement_status`, `passout_year`, `company_name` |
| `sort_order` | string | ❌ | `asc` or `desc` (default) |
| `page` / `limit` | number | ❌ | Default: 1/10 |

#### Response — Includes Placement Stats

```json
{
  "data": {
    "placements": [ "..." ],
    "stats": {
      "total_placements": 120,
      "unique_students": 95,
      "unique_companies": 18,
      "avg_package": 525000,
      "highest_package": 1800000,
      "lowest_package": 350000,
      "offered_count": 30,
      "accepted_count": 45,
      "joined_count": 40,
      "rejected_count": 3,
      "cancelled_count": 2,
      "verified_offers": 85
    }
  },
  "pagination": { "page": 1, "limit": 10, "total": 120, "totalPages": 12 }
}
```

> [!TIP]
> Stats are scoped by `passout_year` if provided, otherwise college-wide. Use this for placement dashboards.

