### API #79 — Update Placement Status

| Item | Value |
|------|-------|
| **Method** | `PATCH` |
| **URL** | `/api/college/update_placement_status/:placementId` |

```json
{ "placement_status": "accepted", "remarks": "Student confirmed via email" }
```

#### Status Transition Rules

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> offered: Placement created
    offered --> accepted
    offered --> rejected
    offered --> cancelled
    accepted --> joined
    accepted --> cancelled
    joined --> cancelled: Student leaves

    note right of rejected: Terminal
    note right of cancelled: Terminal
```

#### Auto acceptance_status Mapping

| Placement Status | Auto acceptance_status |
|-----------------|----------------------|
| `accepted` | `accepted` |
| `joined` | `accepted` |
| `rejected` | `rejected` |
| `offered` / `cancelled` | No auto-set |

