## 3. Integration Guide

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A[Job Postings] --> B[Applications]
    B --> C[Round Results]
    B --> D["Placement Results ✨ NEW"]
    D --> E["Dashboard Stats"]
    D --> F["Placement Policies"]
    subgraph Verification
        D --> G[Offer Letter Verify]
    end
```

### Complete Lifecycle
1. Job published → Students apply
2. Applications screened → shortlisted
3. Rounds conducted → results recorded (Round Results API)
4. Final round passed → Application `selected`
5. **Create Placement** → auto-sets application to `offered`
6. Offer verification → admin verifies document
7. Status: `offered → accepted → joined` (happy path)
8. Stats aggregated for placement dashboard

